# Git commits (this project)

When the user asks for a **`git commit`** (or staged commit, amend, rebase message): do **not** append **`Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`** or any similar Cursor/agent co-author trailer unless they **explicitly** request attribution.
